**Design Tokens**
- Card: rounded-2xl (16px), border Lilac/40, shadow သန့်သန့်
- Primary button: Violet bg, အဖြူ စာ, hover → Lilac
- Secondary button: အဖြူ bg, Violet border + Violet စာ
